# Both refusals apply and origin is checked first. The order is fixed here
# because the wrapper reads the exit code, and a refusal that changed which
# code it reported by what else was wrong would be unreadable.
run available
exit 1
unreachable
file tasks/zzz.md
	---
	id: Z
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: maybe
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: cannot reach origin to check claimed branches
